{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "566fbf99b529ccc0c2a38fc885e7a09ec8881e3f211a8f15a0cb210892229410", "ja": "お～。初恋、ですか～。\nおふたりは、何て答えたんですか～？", "zh": "哦～初恋，是吗～  \n你们两位回答了什么呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "98e618ec32a730504e9c26637de8a626046d113c158b01a8000cfe914606d905", "ja": "えっと、私はどう答えたんだっけかな……\nふ、風花さんは、何て書いたんですか？", "zh": "呃，我当时是怎么回答来着……\n风、风花小姐写了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a4b2b002a944864ae239a100509050f14ca383a6b545d29c9163efb9a44f0d07", "ja": "ええっ、わ、私！？\nわ、私は、その……『ヒミツです♪』って……。", "zh": "诶诶，我、我吗！？\n我、我那个……写的是“秘密♪”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1003_null", "source_sha256": "8eb363af7a4988b86bfee0510c7f10ec1d6443e74df9ed837c329ebe0e386b59", "ja": "ガチャ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "8216a03a5158344f889dbea9dfad3084333033baa631ba5fbd955f1378336ceb", "ja": "はいほー！！！", "zh": "嗨——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "61753f46bcdebe032e05c8742de4198197cbc6159c3cb4bd8ecd2f517cd4d056", "ja": "キャッ！？", "zh": "呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "61753f46bcdebe032e05c8742de4198197cbc6159c3cb4bd8ecd2f517cd4d056", "ja": "キャッ！？", "zh": "呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "89d1c81ca8ae3aa5119dbcf4cef3cacb241493d0999a56e8b99d2c85d950f684", "ja": "その話、姫にくわしく聞かせてほしいのです！", "zh": "那件事，姬想听你详细说说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "2618efca2160050de1a28bca72ecd0c53c2cadb035acffee69d2d6a1d7afb944", "ja": "ずるいですよ、徳川さん。\n……豊川さん。私にも、くわしく。", "zh": "这可不公平，德川小姐。\n……丰川小姐。也请详细告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4b91195989b546c79d59a467e5011e9de15eb2aa0bda646687de811c052500e7", "ja": "こらこら、ふたりとも……驚かせちゃダメだろう。\nみんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "喂喂，你们两个……可不能吓人啊。\n大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "194a0bdf6adcdd2457edd01d152cfd1d90284a146dbc2edd49890428119f728e", "ja": "おや～、まつりちゃんに、瑞希さん～。\n{$P$}さんも、お疲れさまです～。", "zh": "哎呀～是小祭和瑞希呀～。\n{$P$}先生也辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1011_p", "source_sha256": "01428af428ed143bff68aa688be7998bda206adf6a8670f1be9ae0acfdf36efa", "ja": "全員揃ってるな。それじゃ、早速だけど……\n次の定期公演のミーティングを始めよう！", "zh": "大家都到齐了。那就事不宜迟……\n开始下次定期公演的会议吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "05ffd0856d5647722ed9dc1b8219618767189bf2351bbdfdfe7a4335730f0505", "ja": "おお～……。", "zh": "哦喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "05ffd0856d5647722ed9dc1b8219618767189bf2351bbdfdfe7a4335730f0505", "ja": "おお～……。", "zh": "哦喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "05ffd0856d5647722ed9dc1b8219618767189bf2351bbdfdfe7a4335730f0505", "ja": "おお～……。", "zh": "哦喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "05ffd0856d5647722ed9dc1b8219618767189bf2351bbdfdfe7a4335730f0505", "ja": "おお～……。", "zh": "哦喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "05ffd0856d5647722ed9dc1b8219618767189bf2351bbdfdfe7a4335730f0505", "ja": "おお～……。", "zh": "哦喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "506eeb31914e26166f5396be10774faafeb91eeb4b7a5cb4371cdb93826c37e1", "ja": "わんだほー！な、恋の歌なのです～！", "zh": "太棒了——！是关于恋爱的歌曲呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "21aa8e3e03112406842aec5d29988b67e84d02cd8011340bdb388ec781275b7e", "ja": "なるほど、それで私が公演のメンバーに。\n……恋の歌、経験済みだぞ。", "zh": "原来如此，所以我才会成为公演成员。  \n……恋爱之歌，我已经有经验了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "b69f52e6053495555ea208bd934594e62351b7b146a895cdecac5a1a9da3e9c8", "ja": "なんと、ここでも初恋ですか～。\nむ～ん……。", "zh": "没想到在这里也是初恋吗～  \n唔～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1022_p", "source_sha256": "9a268e0e49c6af675f8d40793406cae509787f46dfcd9a1580e0232128be5f0c", "ja": "美也、難しい顔をしてるけど……\nあまりピンと来ないとか？", "zh": "美也，你一脸严肃……是不太能理解吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "ab214936a0625c19ea87d406b5f162b3aa79a3ad69e12a95c7205585bfd6f30e", "ja": "とっても素敵な曲だとは思うんですけど、\nよくわからなくて～。", "zh": "我觉得是首非常棒的歌，只是……我不太明白呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "88e46138b12605bd02dcf541d742ac7b8f19efc13c86725844006b0656b6ac1a", "ja": "よくわからないって、初恋が？", "zh": "你说不太明白，是指初恋吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "153641a10a363098f50a3ae80e28f1ee81720a625dd5b00b3124356630c8c207", "ja": "はい～。初恋……さっきから考えてるんですけど、\n私の中に見当たらない気がして～。", "zh": "是的～。初恋……我从刚才起一直在想，可是感觉在我心里找不到呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "bd48a1b356b530ae4381313e19de7ac93bf4f4df48144e5c5ab353a0549cc4f4", "ja": "どんな感じになると、恋っていうんでしょうか～？", "zh": "要到什么感觉，才算是恋爱呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "15f24d2838acfc38cefd2b404e67db580846d2d7fbb6312d26ec691f4ff719a3", "ja": "そっかぁ……。でも、恋がどんな感じって、\n言葉で説明するのは難しいよね……。", "zh": "这样啊……不过，要用语言说明恋爱是什么感觉，确实很难呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "16db0893f77a7ca879e4d5d6c6dc988996166352e2bd66e3d4a2071201eac7e1", "ja": "つまり、美也ちゃんはまだ恋をしたことがない。\n……それはそれで、美味しいのです！", "zh": "也就是说，美也还没谈过恋爱。\n……不过这样也很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "147b9025b24ec5a84d5f29de4fefdc226a0eec1c6d8bee6541c941620725bd0f", "ja": "美味しい、ですか～？", "zh": "好吃……吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "9cd368c1f172662233d7d0877bf83b663b57e2094bcd6efe498239b8e92e4068", "ja": "なるほど……今は知らなくても、知ることができる。\nこれから経験できるということですね。", "zh": "原来如此……现在即使还不知道，也可以去了解。\n也就是说，今后可以亲身体验到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "0ac46121bf43994a2c4dcf7577a1fce0d156a922fc5a103fd8e8a04c26ebc3bd", "ja": "そうかもしれないけど、公演まで一ヶ月くらいだよ？\nしようと思ってできることじゃないような……。", "zh": "也许是这样，可距离公演只剩一个月左右了哦？\n这可不是想做就能做到的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "3ed815b5ef3072c6b2d972a0a19e03f86724414854278928aff61563604ee732", "ja": "それなら、姫のおすすめの少女漫画があるのです！\n初恋を知るためにも、読んでみてほしいのです♪", "zh": "那样的话，姬这里有一本推荐的少女漫画哦！\n为了了解初恋，也希望你能读一读♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "1df4554ba05f92a265fd6a9743de9836886e8f390d1a0971f4dca97cb7854340", "ja": "なるほど、わかりました～。\nそれでは初恋に、挑戦してみようと思います～。", "zh": "原来如此，我明白了～  \n那么，我想试着挑战一下初恋～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1034_p", "source_sha256": "e71bbee6960e302d95a6f37b80e11f0f71337cb8754022fac68834188b4c7f8e", "ja": "え！？", "zh": "诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1035_021mat", "source_sha256": "a07e492082809b2fbfcb253ec41ab5d7be8d7154dbb69b76ed62daa0a1bf964e", "ja": "美也ちゃんが、恋に興味津々……！\n今回の公演、とっても楽しくなりそうなのです♪", "zh": "美也居然对恋爱兴趣十足……！感觉这次公演会变得特别有趣呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "8a25d387aad96a25163170d240cac0cf7c93099b7ac7cff9d6cd9021153c8d5d", "ja": "私も、恋の歌の先輩として、頼りになるところを\n見せたいと思います。……誕生日的には、妹ですが。", "zh": "我作为唱恋爱歌曲的前辈，也会展现可靠的一面给你看。……不过按生日来说，我是妹妹呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1037_042miy", "source_sha256": "247979bebe0375d9b2bca1b630c80f0aac089a2105351ff5a95444b6d786c22c", "ja": "はい、よろしくお願いします～。\n新曲を上手に歌うためにも、がんばりますよ～。お～！", "zh": "好的，请多多指教～  \n为了把新歌唱好，我也会努力的哦～哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1038_001har", "source_sha256": "fcbf500f7bbc1b14f7d1d18295c2eb8236635bbc0bed251a735e13af2e3c6133", "ja": "流れでいろいろ決まっちゃいましたけど、\nいいんでしょうか……？", "zh": "顺势就把各种事情都定下来了，真的没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1039_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2a0067aed017fd85bae9e584b39abd612519798f1ad5be3fadb571914fed02e8", "ja": "勢いも大事だって言うし……\n何より、美也ちゃんの希望だから……？", "zh": "都说一鼓作气也很重要……\n更何况，这是美也的愿望……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1040_p", "source_sha256": "3b9259bc1ed6a358ef9b2dcd66048b454cd8415ccb8f71807960b8df7fa6169a", "ja": "（わからないなら実践、\n美也らしい発想ではあるけど、大丈夫かな……）", "zh": "（不知道的话就亲自实践，这倒是很有美也的风格，不过没问题吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_085_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_085_1041_p", "source_sha256": "0ed96402f00b5b2ea4821e03ee246f033203915760d0f456c514f85c97480f89", "ja": "（ひとまず、様子を見守る事にしてみよう）", "zh": "（总之，先观察一下情况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
